For proprietary, commercial, and enterprise use where GPL-3.0 terms are not
suitable or desired.

### Commercial License Pricing Tiers (Software/Firmware Only)

| Tier | License Type | Annual Revenue | Price | Features |
|------|--------------|----------------|-------|----------|
| **Starter** | Single Developer | < $100K | $499/year | 1 developer, 1 project, community support |
| **Professional** | Small Team | $100K - $1M | $1,999/year | Up to 5 developers, 3 projects, email support |
| **Business** | Organization | $1M - $10M | $7,999/year | Up to 25 developers, unlimited projects, priority support |
| **Enterprise** | Large Organization | $10M - $100M | $24,999/year | Unlimited developers, unlimited projects, dedicated support, SLA |
| **Enterprise Plus** | Fortune 500 | > $100M | Custom | Custom terms, on-premise deployment, 24/7 support, custom SLA |

### One-Time Perpetual License Options

| Tier | License Type | Price | Features |
|------|--------------|-------|----------|
